                                "sense_id": "06b336f9-c084-3c36-842f-93ffa6c410cb",
                                "text": "One of Hecker's successors at the honest task of baking was Peter M. Baldwin, known to all as the 'General' — a tall, spare, osseous sort of man, built on the large Western plan, and thought to resemble Andrew Jackson."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88d0bd99-ba15-4df5-bdbb-b3c450b14948",
                                "sense_id": "06b336f9-c084-3c36-842f-93ffa6c410cb",
                                "text": "It could be some kind of inception based advertising campaign… make people feel vulnerable so that they want to summon some osseous defenders?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
